# text = It is a very long way from here she replied timidly said I , in some surprise said the little creature I cannot describe how much I was impressed by this appeal and the energy with which it was made , which brought a tear into the child's clear eye , and made her slight figure tremble as she looked up into my face said I She put her hand in mind as confidingly as if she had known me from her cradle , and we trudged away together ; the little creature accommodating her pace to mine , and rather seeming to lead and take care of me than I to be protecting her .
