# text = As for Kit himself ( whose laugh had been all the time one of that sort which very little would change into a cry ) he carried a large slice of bread and meat and a mug of beer into a corner , and applied himself to disposing of them with great voracity said the old man turning to me with a sigh , as if I had spoken to him but that moment said I returned the old man thoughtfully
