# text = The child only answered by her caresses , and laid her head upon his breast said the grandfather , pressing her closer to him and glancing towards me replied the child with great earnestness Kit , who in despatching his bread and meat had been swallowing two-thirds of his knife at every mouthful with the coolness of a juggler , stopped short in his operations on being thus appealed to , and bawled after which he incapacitated himself for further conversation by taking a most prodigious sandwich at one bite said the old men , patting the child's cheek said the child returned the old man then he muttered again between his teeth , ' The time must come , I am very sure it must .
