# text = The old man and another person were together in the back part , and there seemed to have been high words between them , for their voices which were raised to a very high pitch suddenly stopped on my entering , and the old man advancing hastily towards me , said in a tremulous tone that he was very glad I had come said he , pointing to the man whom I had found in company with him returned the other , after bestowing a stare and a frown on me cried the old man , turning feebly upon him returned the other cried the old man , passionately clasping his hands and looking upward
