# text = He furthermore took occasion to apologize for any negligence that might be perceptible in his dress , on the ground that last night he had had ' the sun very strong in his eyes' ; by which expression he was understood to convey to his hearers in the most delicate manner possible , the information that he had been extremely drunk said Mr Swiveller with a sigh said his friend , half aside cried Mr Swiveller , tapping his nose repled his friend said Mr Swiveller with that , he winked as if in preservation of some deep secret , and folding his arms and leaning back in his chair , looked up at the ceiling with profound gravity .
