# text = The young man reclined against a table at no great distance from his friend , in apparent indifference to everything that had passed ; and I -- who felt the difficulty of any interference , notwithstanding that the old man had appealed to me , both by words and looks -- made the best feint I could of being occupied in examining some of the goods that were disposed for sale , and paying very little attention to a person before me .
