# text = The silence was not of long duration , for Mr Swiveller , after favouring us with several melodious assurances that his heart was in the Highlands , and that he wanted but his Arab steed as a preliminary to the achievement of great feats of valour and loyalty , removed his eyes from the ceiling and subsided into prose again said Mr Swiveller stopping short , as if the idea had suddenly occurred to him , and speaking in the same audible whisper as before returned his friend peevishly said Dick Emboldened as it seemed by this reply to enter into a more general conversation , Mr Swiveller plainly laid himself out to captivate our attention .
