# text = The creature appeared quite horrible with his monstrous head and little body , as he rubbed his hands slowly round , and round , and round again -- with something fantastic even in his manner of performing this slight action -- and , dropping his shaggy brows and cocking his chin in the air , glanced upward with a stealthy look of exultation that an imp might have copied and appropriated to himself he said , putting his hand into his breast and sidling up to the old man as he spoke said the old man with something like a groan echoed the dwarf , approaching close to his ear said the other with a haggard look He said no more , but taking the money turned away with a slow , uncertain step , and pressed his hand upon his head like a weary and dejected man . the dwarf watched him sharply , while he passed into the little sitting-room and locked it in an iron safe above the chimney-piece ; and after musing for a short space , prepared to take his leave , observing that unless he made good haste , Mrs Quilp would certainly be in fits on his return he added With that he bowed and leered at me , and with a keen glance around which seemed to comprehend every object within his range of vision , however , small or trivial , went his way .
