# text = The opinion was not the result of hasty consideration , for which indeed there was no opportunity at that time , as the child came directly , and soon occupied herself in preparations for giving Kit a writing lesson , of which it seemed he had a couple every week , and one regularly on that evening , to the great mirth and enjoyment both of himself and his instructress .
