# text = Here he by no means diminished the impression he had just produced , for he ate hard eggs , shell and all , devoured gigantic prawns with the heads and tails on , chewed tobacco and water-cresses at the same time and with extraordinary greediness , drank boiling tea without winking , bit his fork and spoon till they bent again , and in short performed so many horrifying and uncommon acts that the women were nearly frightened out of their wits , and began to doubt if he were really a human creature .
