# text = The dwarf muttering a terrible oath looked round as if for some weapon with which to inflict condign punishment upon his disobedient wife . the submissive little woman hurriedly entreated him not to be angry , and promised to do as he bade her whispered Quilp , nipping and pinching her arm Mrs Quilp departed according to order , and her amiable husband , ensconcing himself behind the partly opened door , and applying his ear close to it , began to listen with a face of great craftiness and attention .
