# text = Poor Mrs Quilp was thinking , however , in what manner to begin or what kind of inquiries she could make ; and it was not until the door , creaking in a very urgent manner , warned her to proceed without further consideration , that the sound of her voice was heard returned Nell innocently returned Mrs Quilp , with an uneasy glance towards it said the child eagerly said Mrs Quilp .
