# text = In a few minutes Mr Quilp returned , and expressed the utmost surprise to find her in this condtiion , which he did very naturally and with admirable effect , for that kind of acting had been rendered familiar to him by long practice , and he was quite at home in it said the dwarf , squinting in a hideous manner to imply that his wife was to follow his lead Mr Quilp unintentionally adopted the very best means he could have devised for the recovery of his young visitor , by patting her on the head .
