# text = The good effect of this politic course was demonstrated by the speedy arrive of a small pewter pyramid , curously constructed of platters and covers , whereof the boiled-beef-plates formed the base , and a foaming quart-pot the apex ; the structure being resolved into its component parts afforded all things requisite and necessary for a hearty meal , to which Mr Swiveller and his friend applied themselves with great keenness and enjoyment said Dick , sticking his fork into a large carbuncular potato
