# text = Near the door sat Miss Sophy , still fluttered and confused by the attentions of Mr Cheggs , and by her side Richard Swiveller lingered for a moment to exchange a few parting words murmured Dick , looking gloomily upon her said Miss Sophy , whose heart sank within her at the result of her stratagem , but who affected a light indifference notwithstanding echoed Dick bitterly said Miss Sophy said Dick Miss Sophy bit her lip and affected to look with great interest after Mr Cheggs , who was quaffing lemonade in the distance said Dick , rather oblivious of the purpose with which he had really come said Miss Sophy with downcast eyes said Dick said Richard Swiviller to himself when he had reached home and was hanging over the candle with the extinguisher in his hand The balmy ' came almost as soon as it was courted .
