# text = For , it was not the monotonous days unchequered by variety and uncheered by pleasant companionship , it was not the dark dreary evenings or the long solitary nights , it was not the absence of every slight and easy pleasure for which young hearts beat high , or the knowing nothing of childhood but its weakness and its easily wounded spirit , that had wrung such tears from Nell .
