# text = There was a crooked stack of chimneys on one of the roofs , in which , by often looking at them , she had fancied ugly faces that were frowning over at her and trying to peer into the room ; and she felt glad when it grew too dark to make them out , though she was sorry too , when the man came to light the lamps in the street -- for it made it late , and very dull inside .
