# text = Without relaxing his pace , or stopping to take breath , this mysterious individual dashed on through a great many alleys and narrow ways until he at length arrived in a square paved court , when he subsided into a walk , and making for a small house from the window of which a light was shining , lifted the latch of the door and passed in cried a woman turning sharply round said Kit With which words , he sat down by the fire and looked very mournful and discontented .
