# text = So he rocked the cradle with his foot ; made a face at the rebel in the clothes-basket , which put him in high good-humour directly ; and stoutly determined to be talkative and make himself agreeable said Kit , taking out his clasp-knife , and falling upon a great piece of bread and meat which she had had ready for him , hours before said Mrs Nubbles returned Kit contemptuously . ' Wait till he's a widder and works like you do , and gets as little , and does as much , and keeps his spirit up the same , and then I'll ask him what's o'clock and trust him for being right to half a second said Mrs Nubbles , evading the point replied her son , taking up the porter pot inquired Mrs Nubbles said Kit returned his mother said Kit , ' I forgot that .
