# text = I said worse luck , because I've been watching ever since eight o'clock , and seen nothing of her cried his mother , stopping in her work and looking round replied Kit , with something like a blush on his uncouth face Mrs Nubbles ironed away in silence for a minute or two , and coming to the fireplace for another iron , glanced stealthily at Kit while she rubbed it on a board and dusted it with a duster , but said nothing until she had returned to her table again : when , holding the iron at an alarmingly short distance from her cheek , to test its temperature , and looking round with a smile , she observed interposed Kit with a perfect apprehension of what was to follow
