# text = The footsteps drew nearer , the door was opened with a hasty hand , and the child herself , pale and breathless , and hastily wrapped in a few disordered garments , hurried into the room cried mother and son together she returned said Kit , seizing his brimless hat cried Nell roared Kit said the child Kit looked at her with his eyes stretched wide ; and opened and shut his mouth a great many times ; but couldn't get out one word said the child roared Kit returned the child with tearful eyes The unfortunate Kit looked at his young mistress harder and harder , and with eyes growing wider and wider , but was perfectly motionless and silent said the child , looking to the woman and laying it on the table With the tears streaming down her face , and her slight figure trembling with the agitation of the scene she had left , the shock she had received , the errand she had just discharged , and a thousand painful and affectionate feelings , the child hastened to the door , and disappeared as rapidly as she had come .
