# text = Looking down , she recognised Kit , whose endeavours to attract her attention had roused her from her sad reflections said the boy in a low voice replied the child , doubtful whether she ought to hold any communication with the supposed culprit , but inclining to her old favourite still the boy replied returned the child replied Kit said the child returned Kit said the child eagerly cried the boy coming under the window , and speaking in a lower tone replied the child said the boy , pointing towards the sick room added the child , unable to restrain her tears said Kit These words of encouragement and consolation were few and roughly said , but they affected the child and made her , for the moment , weep the more said the boy anxiously rejoined the child said the boy The child looked gratefully and kindly at him , but waited that he might speak again said Kit hesitating Here Kit faltered so long that the child entreated him to speak out , and quickly , for it was very late , and time to shut the window cried Kit with sudden boldness
# sent_id = 465
