# text = And so he did said the dwarf , sitting down opposite him said the old man feebly said the dwarf , raising his voice , for the old man's senses were duller than they had been said the old man pursued Quilp after a short pause returned the old man bawled the dwarf nodding his head replied the old man said the dwarf returned the old man said the dwarf returned the old man Mr Quilp seemed rather puzzled by the strange , even spiritless way in which all this was said ; but as the old man nodded his head and repeated he had no excuse for dwelling on the subject any further , and so took a friendly leave with many expressions of good-will and many compliments to his friend on his looking so remarkably well ; and went below stairs to report progress to Mr Brass .
