# text = They were alone together , once again ; every object was bright and fresh ; nothing reminded them , otherwise than by contrast , of the monotony and constraint they had left behind ; church towers and steeples , frowning and dark at other times , now shone in the sun ; each humble nook and corner rejoiced in light ; and the sky , dimmed only by excessive distance , shed its placid smile on everything beneath .
