# text = While the attorney was thus engaged , the dwarf was groping under the table , muttering desperate imprecations on himself , and mankind in general , and all inanimate objects to boot , which suggested to Mr Brass the question said the dwarf , looking viciously about him returned Mr Brass repeated Quilp with a sneer Not caring to represent to the dwarf in his present humour , that the loss of a key by another person could scarcely be said to affect his ( Brass's ) legal knowledge in any material degree , Mr Brass humbly suggested that it must have been forgotten over night , and was , doubtless , at that moment in its native key-hole .
