# text = Dick was pondering what these words might mean , and still more what the presence of Mr Brass might mean , when Mrs Quilp came hurrying down stairs , declaring that the rooms above were empty said the dwarf answered his trembling wife said Mr Brass , clapping his hands once , with an emphasis Quilp looked frowningly at him , and frowningly at his wife , and frowningly at Richard Swiveller ; but , receiving no enlightenment from any of them , hurried up stairs , whence he soon hurried down again , confirming the report which had already been made he said , glancing at Swiveller Mr Swiveller looked , as he was , all open-mouthed astonishment .
