# text = Assured that it was Kit , though he saw little more than his nose , Mr Quilp hailed him by his name ; whereupon Kit came in and demanded what he wanted said the dwarf rejoined Kit , looking round answered Quilp sharply said Kit retorted Quilp said the boy , in evident surprise cried Quilp replied the boy said Quilp Kit , who knew no particular reason why he should keep the matter secret now , related the purpose for which he had come on that occasion , and the proposal he had made said the dwarf after a little consideration cried Kit eagerly returned the dwarf Kit might have returned some answer which would not have been agreeable to his irascible questioner , if the boy from the wharf , who had been skulking about the room in search of anything that might have been left about by accident , had not happened to cry rejoined Quilp said Kit , stepping forward cried the other boy roared Quilp Without further persuasion , the two boys fell upon each other , tooth and nail , while Quilp , holding up the cage in one hand , and chopping the ground with his knife in an ecstasy , urged them on by his taunts and cries to fight more fiercely .
