# text = When this fit was over , Kit exhibited the bird to both children , as a great and precious rarity -- it was only a poor linnet -- and looking about the wall for an old nail , made a scaffolding of a chair and table and twisted it out with great exultation said the boy So , the scaffolding was made again , and Kit , climbing up with the poker for a hammer , knocked in the nail and hung up the cage , to the immeasurable delight of the whole family .
