# text = When it had been adjusted and straightened a great many times , and he had walked backwards into the fire-place in his admiration of it , the arrangement was pronounced to be perfect said the boy As it was very easy for Kit to persuade himself that the old house was in his way , his way being anywhere , he tried to look upon his passing it once more as a matter of imperative and disagreeable necessity , quite apart from any desire of his own , to which he could not choose but yield .
