# text = At length these streets becoming more straggling yet , dwindled and dwindled away , until there were only small garden patches bordering the road , with many a summer house innocent of paint and built of old timber or some fragments of a boat , green as the tough cabbage-stalks that grew about it , and grottoed at the seams with toad-stools and tight-sticking snails .
