# text = As he yielded to this suggestion a ready and rapturous assent , they all rose and walked away together ; he keeping close to the box of puppets in which he was quite absorbed , the merry little man carrying it slung over his arm by a strap attached to it for the purpose , Nelly having hold of her grandfather's hand , and Mr Codlin sauntering slowly behind , casting up at the church tower and neighbouring trees such looks as he was accustomed in town-practice to direct to drawing-room and nursery windows , when seeking for a profitable spot on which to plant the show .
