# text = Here he had the gratification of finding that his fears were without foundation , for the landlord was leaning against the door-post looking lazily at the rain , which had by this time begun to descend heavily , and no tinkling of cracked bell , nor boisterous shout , nor noisy chorus , gave note of company within said Mr Codlin , putting down his burden and wiping his forehead rejoined the landlord , glancing at the sky Mr Codlin followed with a willing mind , and soon found that the landlord had not commended his preparations without good reason .
