# text = This was the character which the little terrier in question had once sustained ; if there had been any doubt upon the subject he would speedily have resolved it by his conduct ; for not only did he , on seeing Short , give the strongest tokens of recognition , but catching sight of the flat box he barked so furiously at the pasteboard nose which he knew was inside , that his master was obliged to gather him up and put him into his pocket again , to the great relief of the whole company .
