# text = The bell was ringing and the course was cleared by the time they reached the ropes , but they dashed across it insensible to the shouts and screeching that assailed them for breaking in upon its sanctity , and creeping under the brow of the hill at a quick pace , made for the open fields Day after day as he bent his steps homeward , returning from some new effort to procure employment , Kit raised his eyes to the window of the little room he had so much commended to the child , and hoped to see some indication of her presence .
