# text = The pony looked with great attention into a fire-plug which was near him , and appeared to be quite absorbed in contemplating it The pony having thoroughly satisfied himself as to the nature and properties of the fire-plug , looked into the air after his old enemies the flies , and as there happened to be one of them tickling his ear at that moment he shook his head and whisked his tail , after which he appeared full of thought but quite comfortable and collected .
