# text = When Kit's mother had done speaking , the old lady struck in again , and said that she was quite sure she was a very honest and very respectable person or she never would have expressed herself in that manner , and that certainly the appearance of the children and the cleanliness of the house deserved great praise and did her the utmost credit , whereat Kit's mother dropped a curtsey and became consoled .
