# text = This feat accomplished he drew himself together in his former position , and laughed excessively cried Quilp , rattling on the table in a dexterous manner with his fist and elbow alternately , in a kind of tune said Dick screamed the dwarf said Dick rejoined Quilp said Richard Swiveller , stopping short in the act of raising the glass to his lips and looking at the dwarf in a species of stupor as he flourished his arms and legs about This candid declaration tended rather to increase than restrain Mr Quilp's eccentricities , and Richard Swiveller , astonished to see him in such a roystering vein , and drinking not a little himself , for company -- began imperceptibly to become more companionable and confiding , so that , being judiciously led on by Mr Quilp , he grew at last very confiding indeed .
