# text = As it was , the dwarf remained upon his back in perfect safety , taunting the dog with hideous faces , and triumphing over him in his inability to advance another inch , though there were not a couple of feet between them said Quilp , hissing and worrying the animal till he was nearly mad The dog tore and strained at his chain with starting eyes and furious bark , but there the dwarf lay , snapping his fingers with gestures of defiance and contempt .
