# text = At last it was conveyed to the carrier's , at whose house at Finchley Kit was to find it next day ; and the box being gone , there remained but two questions for consideration : firstly , whether the carrier would lose , or dishonestly feign to lose , the box upon the road ; secondly , whether Kit's mother perfectly understood how to take care of herself in the absence of her son said Mrs Nubbles apprehensively , in reference to the first point returned Kit , with a serious look said his mother Kit inwardly resolved that he would never tempt a carrier any more , save with an empty box ; and having formed this Christian determination , he turned his thoughts to the second question said Mrs Nubbles rejoined her son disconsolately
