# text = With more kisses , and hugs , and tears , than many young gentlemen who start upon their travels , and leave well-stocked homes behind them , would deem within the bounds of probability ( if matter so low could be herein set down ), Kit left the house at an early hour next morning , and set out to walk to Finchley ; feeling a sufficient pride in his appearance to have warranted his excommunication from Little Bethel from that time forth , if he had ever been one of that mournful congregation .
