# text = On the contrary , Mr Quilp was all blandness and suavity , and presided over the case-bottle of rum with extraordinary open-heartedness said Quilp said Trent cried Quilp was the unfortunate reply thought Quilp said Quilp Mr Quilp accompanied this admission with such an awful wink , indicative of old rovings and backslidings , that Mrs Jiniwin was indignant , and could not forbear from remarking under her breath that he might at least put off his confessions until his wife was absent ; for which act of boldness and insubordination Mr Quilp first stared her out of countenance and then drank her health ceremoniously said Quilp setting down his glass
