# text = As they passed onward , parting the boughs that clustered in their way , the serenity which the child had first assumed , stole into her breast in earnest ; the old man cast no longer fearful looks behind , but felt at ease and cheerful , for the further they passed into the deep green shade , the more they felt that the tranquil mind of God was there , and shed its peace on them .
