# text = But , the great ornaments of the walls were certain moral sentences fairly copied in good round text , and well-worked sums in simple addition and multiplication , evidently achieved by the same hand , which were plentifully pasted all round the room : for the double purpose , as it seemed , of bearing testimony to the excellence of the school , and kindling a worthy emulation in the bosoms of the scholars said the old schoolmaster , observing that her attention was caught by these latter specimens replied the child modestly he returned , taking out his spectacles and putting them on , to have a better view of the triumphs so dear to his heart
