# text = It happened that at that moment the lady of the caravan had her cup ( which , that everything about her might be of a stout and comfortable kind , was a breakfast cup ) to her lips , and that having her eyes lifted to the sky in her enjoyment of the full flavour of the tea , not unmingled possibly with just the slightest dash or gleam of something out of the suspicious bottle -- but this is mere speculation and not distinct matter of history -- it happened that being thus agreeably engaged , she did not see the travellers when they first came up .
