# text = It was not until she was in the act of getting down the cup , and drawing a long breath after the exertion of causing its contents to disappear , that the lady of the caravan beheld an old man and a young child walking slowly by , and glancing at her proceedings with eyes of modest but hungry admiration cried the lady of the caravan , scooping the crumbs out of her lap and swallowing the same before wiping her lips asked Nell repeated the lady with an air of impatience repeated the lady of the caravan Nell was not a little alarmed to hear this , supposing that the lady might be intimately acquainted with the firm of Short and Codlin ; but what followed tended to reassure her said the lady of the caravan returned the child cried the lady of the caravan in a sort of shriek said the child , fearing she had committed some grievous fault
