# text = Instead of speaking , however , she sat looking at the child for a long time in silence , and then getting up , brought out from a corner a large roll of canvas about a yard in width , which she laid upon the floor and spread open with her foot until it nearly reached from one end of the caravan to the other she said Nell walked down it , and read aloud , in enormous black letters , the inscription said the lady , complacently repeated Nell said the lady Giving the child an encouraging look , intended to reassure her and let her know , that , although she stood in the presence of the original Jarley , she must not allow herself to be utterly overwhelmed and borne down , the lady of the caravan unfolded another scroll , whereon was the inscription and then another scroll , on which was written and then several smaller scrolls with such inscriptions as The genuine and only Jarley Jarley is the delight of the Nobility and Gentry When she had exhibited these leviathans of public announcement to the astonished child , she brought forth specimens of the lesser fry in the shape of hand-bills , some of which were couched in the form of parodies on popular melodies , as I saw thy show in youthful prime while , to consult all tastes , others were composed with a view to the lighter and more facetious spirits , as a parody on the favourite air of beginning
