# text = After an awkward pause , she thrust her head out of the window again , and had another conference with the driver upon some point on which they did not seem to agree quite so readily as on their former topic of discussion ; but they concluded at last , and she addressed the grandfather again said Mrs Jarley said the lady , rising into the tone and manner in which she was accustomed to address her audiences Descending from the sublime when she had reached this point , to the details of common life , Mrs Jarley remarked that with reference to salary she could pledge herself to no specific sum until she had sufficiently tested Nell's abilities , and narrowly watched her in the performance of her duties .
