# text = When the festoons were all put up as tastily as they might be , the stupendous collection was uncovered , and there were displayed , on a raised platform some two feet from the floor , running round the room and parted from the rude public by a crimson rope breast high , divers sprightly effigies of celebrated characters , singly and in groups , clad in glittering dresses of various climes and times , and standing more or less unsteadily upon their legs , with their eyes very wide open , and their nostrils very much inflated , and the muscles of their legs and arms very strongly developed , and all their countenances expressing great surprise .
