# text = Although her duties were sufficiently laborious , Nell found in the lady of the caravan a very kind and considerate person , who had not only a peculiar relish for being comfortable herself , but for making everybody about her comfortable also ; which latter taste , it may be remarked , is , even in persons who live in much finer places than caravans , a far more rare and uncommon one than the first , and is not by any means its necessary consequence .
