# text = As her popularity procured her various little fees from the visitors on which her patroness never demanded any toll , and as her grandfather too was well-treated and useful , she had no cause of anxiety in connexion with the wax-work , beyond that which sprung from her recollection of Quilp , and her fears that he might return and one day suddenly encounter them .
