# text = Then there were so many of them with their great glassy eyes -- and , as they stood one behind the other all about her bed , they looked so like living creatures , and yet so unlike in their grim stillness and silence , that she had a kind of terror of them for their own sakes , and would often lie watching their dusky figures until she was obliged to rise and light a candle , or go and sit at the open window and feel a companionship in the bright stars .
