# text = It was not the lightest part of her sorrow to know that this was done for her said the old man he added hastily said the child looking up returned the old man , checking himself as some impetuous answer rose to his lips said the child earnestly returned the old man , still without looking at her said the child retorted her grandfather , still looking away and seeming to confer with himself resumed the child murmured the old man in the same tone as before said Nell He stopped her with a motion of his hand , and bade her talk to him no more just then , for he was busy .
