# text = When they presented themselves in the midst of the stupendous collection , they found , as Nell had anticipated , that Mrs Jarley was not yet out of bed , and that , although she had suffered some uneasiness on their account overnight , and had indeed sat up for them until past eleven o'clock , she had retired in the persuasion , that , being overtaken by storm at some distance from home , they had sought the nearest shelter , and would not return before morning .
