# text = Miss Monflathers only tossed her head in reply , and the great gate closed upon a bursting heart said Miss Monflathers , turning to Nell The procession filed off , two and two , with the books and parasols , and Miss Monflathers , calling the Baronet's daughter to walk with her and smooth her ruffled feelings , discarded the two teachers -- who by this time had exchanged their smiles for looks of sympathy -- and left them to bring up the rear , and hate each other a little more for being obliged to walk together Mrs Jarley's wrath on first learning that she had been threatened with the indignity of Stocks and Penance , passed all description .
