# text = By morning's cheerful glow , but oftener still by evening's gentle light , the child , with a respect for the short and happy intercourse of these two sisters which forbade her to approach and say a thankful word , although she yearned to do so , followed them at a distance in their walks and rambles , stopping when they stopped , sitting on the grass when they sat down , rising when they went on , and feeling it a companionship and delight to be so near them .
