# text = And so saying Mrs Jarley produced another announcement , wherein it was stated , that , in consequence of numerous inquiries at the wax-work door , and in consequence of crowds having been disappointed in obtaining admission , the Exhibition would be continued for one week longer , and would re-open next day said Mrs Jarley Upon the following day at noon , Mrs Jarley established herself behind the highly-ornamented table , attended by the distinguished effigies before mentioned , and ordered the doors to be thrown open for the readmission of a discerning and enlightened public .
