# text = As the course of this tale requires that we should become acquainted , somewhere hereabouts , with a few particulars connected with the domestic economy of Mr Sampson Brass , and as a more convenient place than the present is not likely to occur for that purpose , the historian takes the friendly reader by the hand , and springing with him into the air , and cleaving the same at a greater rate than ever Don Cleophas Leandro Perez Zambullo and his familiar travelled through that pleasant region in company , alights with him upon the pavement of Bevis Marks .
