# text = One morning Mr Sampson Brass sat upon his stool copying some legal process , and viciously digging his pen deep into the paper , as if he were writing upon the very heart of the party against whom it was directed ; and Miss Sally Brass sat upon her stool making a new pen preparatory to drawing out a little bill , which was her favourite occupation ; and so they sat in silence for a long time , until Miss Brass broke silence said Miss Brass ; for in her mild and feminine lips , Sampson became Sammy , and all things were softened down returned her brother cried Miss Sally said Mr Brass , putting his pen in his mouth , and grinning spitefully at his sister
