# text = As to the divine Miss Sally herself , she rubbed her hands as men of business do , and took a few turns up and down the office with her pen behind her ear said the dwarf , turning briskly to his legal friend returned Brass said Quilp said Brass , like a man abstracted , and looking at the roofs of the opposite houses , with his hands in his pockets Quilp went on cried Brass said Quilp , looking round returned Brass said Quilp replied the lawyer , putting on his hat The dwarf glanced sarcastically at his brazen friend , and , with a short dry cough , turned upon his heel to bid adieu to Miss Sally .
