# text = Mr Swiveller had scarcely sprung off his seat and commenced the performance of a maniac hornpipe , when he was interrupted , in the fulness of his joy at being again alone , by the opening of the door , and the reappearance of Miss Sally's head said Miss Brass returned Dick he added inwardly said Miss Brass replied Dick said Miss Brass , retiring rejoined Dick when she had shut the door Uttering these expressions of good-will with extreme gravity , Mr Swiveller sat down in the client's chair and pondered ; then took a few turns up and down the room and fell into the chair again said Dick
