# text = This is the more probable from the circumstance of Mr Swiveller directing his observations to the ceiling , which these bodily personages are usually supposed to inhabit -- except in theatrical cases , when they live in the heart of the great chandelier resumed Dick after a thoughtful silence , and telling off the circumstances of his position , one by one , upon his fingers said Mr Swiveller , taking his leave of the ceiling with a significant nod Dismissing the subject of his downfall with these reflections , which were no doubt very profound , and are indeed not altogether unknown in certain systems of moral philosophy , Mr Swiveller shook off his despondency and assumed the cheerful ease of an irresponsible clerk .
