# text = Having , as it were , taken formal possession of his clerkship in virtue of these proceedings , he opened the window and leaned negligently out of it until a beer-boy happened to pass , whom he commanded to set down his tray and to serve him with a pint of mild porter , which he drank upon the spot and promptly paid for , with the view of breaking ground for a system of future credit and opening a correspondence tending thereto , without loss of time .
