# text = And this had passed into such a habit with him , that , if he could not be correctly said to have his tongue at his fingers' ends , he might certainly be said to have it anywhere but in his face : which being , as we have already seen , of a harsh and repulsive character , was not oiled so easily , but frowned above all the smooth speeches -- one of nature's beacons , warning off those who navigated the shoals and breakers of the World , or of that dangerous strait the Law , and admonishing them to seek less treacherous harbours and try their fortune elsewhere .
