# text = It might have been expected that when the play was done , both players and audience would have dispersed ; but the epilogue was as bad as the play , for no sooner was the Devil dead , than the manager of the puppets and his partner were summoned by the single gentleman to his chamber , where they were regaled with strong waters from his private store , and where they held with him long conversations , the purport of which no human being could fathom .
