# text = I an't a talker returned the little man retorted the other with sudden alacrity With this remonstrance , the melancholy man , who was no other than Mr Thomas Codlin , pushed past his friend and brother in the craft , Mr Harris , otherwise Short or Trotters , and hurried before him to the single gentleman's apartment said the single gentleman said Mr Codlin , turning gruffly to his friend Mr Short obeyed , observing under his breath that his friend seemed unusually and expressing a hope that there was no dairy in the neighbourhood , or his temper would certainly spoil its contents .
