# text = But , from the point where Mr Codlin was charged with sleepiness , he had shown an increasing interest in the discussion : which now attained a very high pitch he said said Short , hesitating , and looking towards his friend cried Short , turning with a look of amazement to his friend returned Mr Codlin Repeating these words with great emotion , Mr Codlin rubbed the bridge of his nose with his coat-sleeve , and shaking his head mournfully from side to side , left the single gentleman to infer that , from the moment when he lost sight of his dear young charge , his peace of mind and happiness had fled said the single gentleman , pacing up and down the room said Short replied Mr Codlin said that gentleman reflectively said Short , turning from his selfish colleague to their new acquaintance said the impatient single gentleman replied Mr Short rapidly said the single gentleman
