# text = The address was given , the two men departed , the crowd went with them , and the single gentleman for two mortal hours walked in uncommon agitation up and down his room , over the wondering heads of Mr Swiveller and Miss Sally Brass Kit -- for it happens at this juncture , not only that we have breathing time to follow his fortunes , but that the necessities of these adventures so adapt themselves to our ease and inclination as to call upon us imperatively to pursue the track we most desire to take --
