# text = Although Kit was in the very highest favour with the old lady and gentleman , and Mr Abel , and Barbara , it is certain that no member of the family evinced such a remarkable partiality for him as the self-willed pony , who , from being the most obstinate and opinionated pony on the face of the earth , was , in his hands , the meekest and most tractable of animals .
