# text = Finally , Kit informed the gentleman that the premises were now to let , and that a board upon the door referred all inquirers to Mr Sampson Brass , Solicitor , of Bevis Marks , from whom he might perhaps learn some further particulars said the gentleman shaking his head cried Mr Witherden in some surprise : having professional knowledge of the gentleman in question was the reply said the Notary , shrugging his shoulders echoed the other Mr Witherden consenting , they walked into that gentleman's private closet , and remained there , in close conversation , for some quarter of an hour , when they returned into the outer office .
