# text = Kit would gladly have declined the proffered honour , but as Mr Swiveller was already established in the seat beside him , he had no means of doing so , otherwise than by a forcible ejectment , and therefore , drove briskly off -- so briskly indeed , as to cut short the leave-taking between Mr Chuckster and his Grand Master , and to occasion the former gentleman some inconvenience from having his corns squeezed by the impatient pony .
