# text = As Whisker was tired of standing , and Mr Swiveller was kind enough to stimulate him by shrill whistles , and various sporting cries , they rattled off at too sharp a pace to admit of much conversation : especially as the pony , incensed by Mr Swiveller's admonitions , took a particular fancy for the lamp-posts and cart-wheels , and evinced a strong desire to run on the pavement and rasp himself against the brick walls .
