# text = It was not , therefore , until they had arrived at the stable , and the chaise had been extricated from a very small doorway , into which the pony dragged it under the impression that he could take it along with him into his usual stall , that Mr Swiveller found time to talk said Richard Kit at first declined , but presently consented , and they adjourned to the neighbouring bar together said Dick , holding up the bright frothy pot Kit pledged him said Dick said Kit , moving away replied his patron said Mr Swiveller Kit shook his head , and glancing slyly at his questioner , thanked him , and made off before he could say another word said Mr Swiveller pondering After pondering deeply and with a face of exceeding wisdom for some time , Mr Swiveller drank some more of the beer , and summoning a small boy who had been watching his proceedings , poured forth the few remaining drops as a libation on the gravel , and bade him carry the empty vessel to the bar with his compliments , and above all things to lead a sober and temperate life , and abstain from all intoxicating and exciting liquors .
