# text = To this , Kit's mother yielded her full assent , and tracing things back from effects to causes , they naturally reverted to their deceased husbands , respecting whose lives , deaths , and burials , they compared notes , and discovered sundry circumstances that tallied with wonderful exactness ; such as Barbara's father having been exactly four years and ten months older than Kit's father , and one of them having died on a Wednesday and the other on a Thursday , and both of them having been of a very fine make and remarkably good-looking , with other extraordinary coincidences .
