# text = At last they got to the theatre , which was Astley's : and in some two minutes after they had reached the yet unopened door , little Jacob was squeezed flat , and the baby had received divers concussions , and Barbara's mother's umbrella had been carried several yards off and passed back to her over the shoulders of the people , and Kit had hit a man on the head with the handkerchief of apples for ' scrowdging ' his parent with unnecessary violence , and there was a great uproar .
