# text = Dear , dear , what a place it looked , that Astley's ; with all the paint , gilding , and looking-glass ; the vague smell of horses suggestive of coming wonders ; the curtain that hid such gorgeous mysteries ; the clean white sawdust down in the circus ; the company coming in and taking their places ; the fiddlers looking carelessly up at them while they tuned their instruments , as if they didn't want the play to begin , and knew it all beforehand !
