# text = Then they fell to work upon the supper in earnest ; and there was Barbara , that foolish Barbara , declaring that she could not eat more than two , and wanting more pressing than you would believe before she would eat four : though her mother and Kit's mother made up for it pretty well , and ate and laughed and enjoyed themselves so thoroughly that it did Kit good to see them , and made him laugh and eat likewise from strong sympathy .
