# text = There was the baby too , who had never closed an eye all night , but had sat as good as gold , trying to force a large orange into his mouth , and gazing intently at the lights in the chandelier -- there he was , sitting up in his mother's lap , staring at the gas without winking , and making indentations in his soft visage with an oyster-shell , to that degree that a heart of iron must have loved him !
