# text = The old lady and Whisker looked on as usual said Mr Garland returned Kit , looking down from the ladder said the old gentleman returned the old gentlemen with a smile said Kit , hammering stoutly at an obdurate nail pursued the old gentleman cried Kit , who had stopped short in his work and faced about on the ladder like some dexterous tumbler said Mr Garland muttered Kit , looking ruefully at his master and mistress said Mr Garland said Kit interposed Mr Garland added the old gentleman with stronger emphasis Kit did suffer one twinge , one momentary pang , in keeping the resolution he had already formed , when this last argument passed swiftly into his thoughts , and conjured up the realization of all his hopes and fancies .
