# text = This salutation was addressed to Mr Chuckster , who , with his hat extremely on one side , and his hair a long way beyond it , came swaggering up the walk returned that gentleman observed Mr Garland replied the clerk Declining to inspect the spanking grey , on the plea that he was but poorly acquainted with such matters , and would but imperfectly appreciate his beauties , Mr Garland invited Mr Chuckster to partake of a slight repast in the way of lunch .
