# text = He was closeted with Mr Witherden for some little time , and Mr Abel had been called in to assist at the conference , before Kit , wondering very much what he was wanted for , was summoned to attend them said the gentleman , turning to him directly he entered the room returned Kit , his eyes sparkling with delight returned the gentleman , shaking his head cried Kit , full of joy and surprise said the strange gentleman , turning thoughtfully to the Notary replied the Notary said Kit , who had listened to this discourse with a lengthening countenance cried the impetuous gentleman said the Notary replied Kit said the single gentleman said the impatient gentleman , catching up his hat In a word , the single gentleman was bursting out of the office , bent upon laying violent hands on Kit's mother , forcing her into a post-chaise , and carrying her off , when this novel kind of abduction was with some difficulty prevented by the joint efforts of Mr Abel and the Notary , who restrained him by dint of their remonstrances , and persuaded him to sound Kit upon the probability of her being able and willing to undertake such a journey on so short a notice .
