# text = Among these was Kit's mother , who , finding it matter of extreme difficulty to keep her eyes open after the fatigues of last night , and feeling their inclination to close strongly backed and seconded by the arguments of the preacher , had yielded to the drowsiness that overpowered her , and fallen asleep ; though not so soundly but that she could , from time to time , utter a slight and almost inaudible groan , as if in recognition of the orator's doctrines .
