# text = In this fearful state of things , distracted by the sudden appearance of Kit , and fascinated by the eyes of the preacher , the miserable Jacob sat bolt upright , wholly incapable of motion , strongly disposed to cry but afraid to do so , and returning his pastor's gaze until his infant eyes seemed starting from their sockets thought Kit .
