# text = One of the low , arched gipsy-tents , common to that people , was pitched hard by , but it either was , or appeared to be , empty said the stout man , looking up from the ground where he was lying at his ease , into her grandfather's face returned Isaac List , who was squatting like a frog on the other side of the fire , and had so screwed himself up that he seemed to be squinting all over said the old man , turning from one to the other The utter irresolution and feebleness of the grey-haired child , contrasted with the keen and cunning looks of those in whose hands he was , smote upon the little listener's heart .
