# text = This was addressed to the gipsy , who crawled into the low tent on all fours , and after some rummaging and rustling returned with a cash-box , which the man who had spoken opened with a key he wore about his person he said , gathering up the money in his hand and letting it drop back into the box , between his fingers , like water Isaac List , with great apparent humility , protested that he had never doubted the credit of a gentleman so notorious for his honourable dealing as Mr Jowl , and that he had hinted at the production of the box , not for the satisfaction of his doubts , for he could have none , but with a view to being regaled with a sight of so much wealth , which , though it might be deemed by some but an unsubstantial and visionary pleasure , was to one in his circumstances a source of extreme delight , only to be surpassed by its safe depository in his own personal pockets .
