# text = Nell , to avoid more questioning , said was the next question ; and this being an easier one to answer , Nell mentioned the name of the village in which their friend the schoolmaster dwelt , as being less likely to be known to the men or to provoke further inquiry said the man Returning his salute and feeling greatly relieved by his departure , Nell looked after him as he mounted one of the horses , and the boat went on .
