# text = Now and then , a village with its modest spire , thatched roofs , and gable-ends , would peep out from among the trees ; and , more than once , a distant town , with great church towers looming through its smoke , and high factories or workshops rising above the mass of houses , would come in view , and , by the length of time it lingered in the distance , show them how slowly they travelled .
