# text = But here again they were disappointed , for the gate was closed , and some fierce dogs , barking at their approach , obliged them to retreat said the child in a weak voice , as they turned away from this last repulse returned the old man fiercely said the child , with a momentary firmness that lost itself in tears cried the old man , clasping his hands and gazing as if for the first time upon her anxious face , her travel-stained dress , and bruised and swollen feet said the child , with assumed cheerfulness , as they walked on looking about them for a shelter , we should find some good old tree , stretching out his green arms as if he loved us , and nodding and rustling as if he would have us fall asleep , thinking of him while he watched .
