# text = But , quickly recovering his self-possession , he threw down his stick and book , and dropping on one knee beside her , endeavoured , by such simple means as occurred to him , to restore her to herself ; while her grandfather , standing idly by , wrung his hands , and implored her with many endearing expressions to speak to him , were it only a word said the schoolmaster , glancing upward into his face rejoined the old man Casting a look upon him , half-reproachful and half-compassionate , the schoolmaster took the child in his arms , and , bidding the old man gather up her little basket and follow him directly , bore her away at his utmost speed .
