# text = And so indeed it was , for the schoolmaster had ordered it to be put down , and it was getting on so well that the doctor might have smelt it if he had tried ; perhaps he did said the doctor , rising gravely suggested the landlady said the doctor , in the tone of a man who makes a dignified concession With which parting injunction , slowly and portentously delivered , the doctor departed , leaving the whole house in admiration of that wisdom which tallied so closely with their own .
