# text = What a soothing , luxurious , drowsy way of travelling , to lie inside that slowly-moving mountain , listening to the tinkling of the horses' bells , the occasional smacking of the carter's whip , the smooth rolling of the great broad wheels , the rattle of the harness , the cheery good-nights of passing travellers jogging past on little short-stepped horses -- all made pleasantly indistinct by the thick awning , which seemed made for lazy listening under , till one fell asleep !
