# text = The cold sharp interval between night and morning -- the distant streak of light widening and spreading , and turning from grey to white , and from white to yellow , and from yellow to burning red -- the presence of day , with all its cheerfulness and life -- men and horses at the plough -- birds in the trees and hedges , and boys in solitary fields , frightening them away with rattles .
