# text = Quilp kept the chaise in sight , mingled with the crowd , learnt the single gentleman's errand , and its failure , and having possessed himself of all that it was material to know , hurried off , reached the inn before him , had the interview just now detailed , and shut himself up in the little room in which he hastily reviewed all these occurrences he repeated , greedily biting his nails he continued , after a thoughtful pause said the dwarf , throwing off a bumper of brandy , and smacking his lips
