# text = Mr Quilp was serenely gazing at the stars , quite absorbed in celestial contemplation cried Mrs Nubbles Mr Quilp affected to start , and looked smilingly round said Kit said Quilp inwardly , with a smile resumed Kit , shouldering the bandbox Quilp said not a word in reply , but walking so close to Kit as to bring his eyes within two or three inches of his face , looked fixedly at him , retreated a little distance without averting his gaze , approached again , again withdrew , and so on for half-a-dozen times , like a head in a phantasmagoria .
