# text = This facetious probability was so congenial to the dwarf's humour , and so exquisitely amusing to him , that he laughed as he went along until the tears ran down his cheeks ; and more than once , when he found himself in a bye-street , vented his delight in a shrill scream , which greatly terrifying any lonely passenger , who happened to be walking on before him expecting nothing so little , increased his mirth , and made him remarkably cheerful and light-hearted .
