# text = At the same table , with both her elbows upon it , was Mrs Jiniwin ; no longer sipping other people's punch feloniously with teaspoons , but taking deep draughts from a jorum of her own ; while her daughter -- not exactly with ashes on her head , or sackcloth on her back , but preserving a very decent and becoming appearance of sorrow nevertheless -- was reclining in an easy chair , and soothing her grief with a smaller allowance of the same glib liquid .
