# text = Keeping his eye fixed on Sampson Brass , he walked up to the table , and beginning with his glass , drank off the contents , and went regularly round until he had emptied the other two , when he seized the case-bottle , and hugging it under his arm , surveyed him with a most extraordinary leer said Quilp cried Brass , recovering his spirits a little said the dwarf , nodding expressively cried the lawyer , retreating backwards towards the door Waiting until Mr Brass's ejaculations died away in the distance ( for he continued to pour them out , all the way down stairs ), Quilp advanced towards the two men , who yet lingered in a kind of stupid amazement said the dwarf , holding the door open with great politeness
