# text = Prolonging his preparations as much as possible , for their greater comfort , that eccentric gentleman superintended the packing of his wardrobe , and having added to it with his own hands , a plate , knife and fork , spoon , teacup and saucer , and other small household matters of that nature , strapped up the portmanteau , took it on his shoulders , and actually marched off without another word , and with the case-bottle ( which he had never once put down ) still tightly clasped under his arm .
