# text = Consigning his heavier burden to the care of Tom Scott when he reached the street , taking a dram from the bottle for his own encouragement , and giving the boy a rap on the head with it as a small taste for himself , Quilp very deliberately led the way to the wharf , and reached it at between three and four o'clock in the morning said Quilp , when he had groped his way to the wooden counting-house , and opened the door with a key he carried about with him With no more formal leave-taking or explanation , he clutched the portmanteau , shut the door on his attendant , and climbing on the desk , and rolling himself up as round as a hedgehog , in an old boat-cloak , fell fast asleep .
# sent_id = 2290
