# text = He also caused to be erected , in the same mouldy cabin , an old ship's stove with a rusty funnel to carry the smoke through the roof ; and these arrangements completed , surveyed them with ineffable delight Enjoining Tom Scott to await his return , and not to stand upon his head , or throw a summerset , or so much as walk upon his hands meanwhile , on pain of lingering torments , the dwarf threw himself into a boat , and crossing to the other side of the river , and then speeding away on foot , reached Mr Swiveller's usual house of entertainment in Bevis Marks , just as that gentleman sat down alone to dinner in its dusky parlour .
