# text = Such inconveniences , however , instead of disgusting the dwarf with his new abode , rather suited his humour ; so , after dining luxuriously from the public-house , he lighted his pipe , and smoked against the chimney until nothing of him was visible through the mist but a pair of red and highly inflamed eyes , with sometimes a dim vision of his head and face , as , in a violent fit of coughing , he slightly stirred the smoke and scattered the heavy wreaths by which they were obscured .
