# text = Peeping cautiously over the side of his hammock , he descried Mrs Quilp , to whom , after contemplating her for some time in silence , he communicated a violent start by suddenly yelling out cried his poor little wife , looking up returned the dwarf said Mrs Quilp , sobbing grinned the dwarf Mrs Quilp durst only make a gesture of entreaty cried the dwarf said his wife , earnestly roared Quilp Mr Quilp delivered this last command in such a very energetic voice , and moreover accompanied it with such a sudden gesture , indicative of an intention to spring out of his hammock , and , night-capped as he was , bear his wife home again through the public streets , that she sped away like an arrow .
