# text = To this , the child , conducting her conversation as upon the occasion of her first interview with Mr Swiveller , again replied said the dwarf , pushing past her into the office So Mr Quilp climbed up to the top of a tall stool to write the note , and the small servant , carefully tutored for such emergencies , looked on with her eyes wide open , ready , if he so much as abstracted a wafer , to rush into the street and give the alarm to the police .
