# text = Whether there was anything in the peculiar slyness of her action which fascinated Mr Quilp , or anything in the expression of her features at the moment which attracted his attention for some other reason ; or whether it merely occurred to him as a pleasant whim to stare the small servant out of countenance ; certain it is , that he planted his elbows square and firmly on the desk , and squeezing up his cheeks with his hands , looked at her fixedly he said after a long pause , stroking his chin retorted Quilp said the child .
