# text = The little old gentleman glanced at the grandfather , and back again at the child , whose hand he took tenderly in his , and held he said said the bachelor Nell accompanied him into the other little rooms , and over both the houses , in which he found various small comforts wanting , which he engaged to supply from a certain collection of odds and ends he had at home , and which must have been a very miscellaneous and extensive one , as it comprehended the most opposite articles imaginable .
