# text = The sexton , as he could not reach to touch him with his crutch , and was too infirm to rise without assistance , called his attention by throwing a little mould upon his red nightcap said David , looking up asked the sexton repeated David replied the sexton ; adding in a half compassionate , half irritable tone , which the old man couldn't hear The old man stopped in his work , and cleansing his spade with a piece of slate he had by him for the purpose -- and scraping off , in the process , the essence of Heaven knows how many Becky Morgans -- set himself to consider the subject .
