# text = From that time , the old man never , for a moment , forgot the weakness and devotion of the child ; from the time of that slight incident , he who had seen her toiling by his side through so much difficulty and suffering , and had scarcely thought of her otherwise than as the partner of miseries which he felt severely in his own person , and deplored for his own sake at least as much as hers , awoke to a sense of what he owed her , and what those miseries had made her .
