# text = Such morsels of enthusiasm are common among the Glorious Apollos , and were indeed the links that bound them together , and raised them above the cold dull earth said Mr Chuckster , taking a stool Mr Swiveller expressed his acknowledgments ; and it appearing on further conversation that he was in good health , and that Mr Chuckster was in the like enviable condition , both gentlemen , in compliance with a solemn custom of the ancient Brotherhood to which they belonged , joined in a fragment of the popular duet of with a long shake ' at the end said Richard replied Mr Chuckster said Dick returned Mr Chuckster , taking out an oblong snuff-box , the lid whereof was ornamented with a fox's head curiously carved in brass said Mr Chuckster interposed Mr Swiveller said Mr Chuckster Mr Chuckster paused , rapped the fox's head exactly on the nose with the knuckle of the fore-finger , took a pinch of snuff , and looked steadily at Mr Swiveller , as much as to say that if he thought he was going to sneeze , he would find himself mistaken said Mr Chuckster said Mr Chuckster , shaking his head gravely , as men are wont to do when they consider things are going a little too far Mr Swiveller , who sat on another stool opposite to his friend , stirred the fire in an excess of sympathy , but said nothing pursued Mr Chuckster with a prophetic look Mr Chuckster being roused , would probably have pursued this subject further , and in more emphatic language , but for a tap at the door , which seeming to announce the arrival of somebody on business , caused him to assume a greater appearance of meekness than was perhaps quite consistent with his late declaration .
