# text = It was towards this moving spectacle that the staircase and the sweet sounds guided Kit ; on whose arrival before his door , Mr Brass stopped his singing , but not his smiling , and nodded affably : at the same time beckoning to him with his pen said Mr Brass , in the pleasantest way imaginable Kit , being rather shy of his friend , made a suitable reply , and had his hand upon the lock of the street door when Mr Brass called him softly back said the attorney in a mysterious and yet business-like way said the lawyer , quitting his stool , and standing before the fire with his back towards it said Kit pursued the lawyer , looking at him in a sort of pensive abstraction thought Kit But he didn't say SO said Mr Brass thought honest Kit , as the attorney pursed up his lips and looked like a man who was struggling with his better feelings said Brass with emotion
