# text = This poetic figure , which Kit took to be in a special allusion to his own checked waistcoat , quite overcame him ; Mr Brass's voice and manner added not a little to its effect , for he discoursed with all the mild austerity of a hermit , and wanted but a cord round the waist of his rusty surtout , and a skull on the chimney-piece , to be completely set up in that line of business said Sampson , smiling as good men smile when they compassionate their own weakness or that of their fellow - creatures
