# text = Whenever Kit came alone , and without the chaise , it always happened that Sampson Brass was reminded of some mission , calling Mr Swiveller , if not to Peckham Rye again , at all events to some pretty distant place from Which he could not be expected to return for two or three hours , or in all probability a much longer period , as that gentleman was not , to say the truth , renowned for using great expedition on such occasions , but rather for protracting and spinning out the time to the very utmost limit of possibility .
