# text = After a moment's reflection , Mr Swiveller determined to forego his responsible duty of setting her right , and to suffer her to talk on ; as it was evident that her tongue was loosened by the purl , and her opportunities for conversation were not so frequent as to render a momentary check of little consequence said the small servant with a shrewd look said Dick replied the small servant , shaking her head said Dick said the small servant said Dick The Marchioness nodded amazingly said Mr Swiveller .
