# text = Yet , for half the night , or more , Mr Swiveller , lying sometimes on his back with his eyes upon the ceiling , and sometimes half out of bed to correct himself by the book , played this unhappy tune over and over again ; never leaving off , save for a minute or two at a time to take breath and soliloquise about the Marchioness , and then beginning again with renewed vigour .
