# text = It was not until he had quite exhausted his several subjects of meditation , and had breathed into the flute the whole sentiment of the purl down to its very dregs , and had nearly maddened the people of the house , and at both the next doors , and over the way -- that he shut up the music-book , extinguished the candle , and finding himself greatly lightened and relieved in his mind , turned round and fell asleep .
