# text = This difficulty overcome , he took his seat at the desk quoth Miss Brass , abruptly breaking silence rejoined Mr Swiveller returned Miss Brass said Mr Swiveller replied Miss Sally thought Richard said Miss Sally Mr Swiveller involuntarily clapped his hands to the jacket to be quite sure that it WAS a jacket and not a skirted coat ; and having satisfied himself of the safety of this , his only moveable in Bevis Marks , made answer in the negative said Miss Brass , pulling out the tin box and refreshing herself with a pinch of snuff cried Dick rejoined Miss Brass emphatically thought Richard , laying down his pen The more he discussed the subject in his thoughts , the more probable it appeared to Dick that the miserable little servant was the culprit .
