# text = Mr Brass , who seemed remarkably inattentive and impatient , mounted on his stool , and beckoning him to come nearer , took him by the button-hole said the lawyer cried Brass said Brass , taking it from him and making some confusion among the papers , in finding a place for it on the desk As Brass spoke , he moved the hat twice or thrice , and shuffled among the papers again , as if in search of something replied Kit with his whole heart said Brass , suddenly turning upon him and thrusting his face close to Kit's with such a repulsive smile that the latter , even in the very height of his gratitude , drew back , quite startled Kit looked at him in some confusion added Sampson , rubbing his hands and veiling himself again in his usual oily manner said Brass Talking as he went , Mr Brass bustled out of the office , and in a very short time returned .
