# text = The beautiful virgin took another pinch , and put the snuff-box in her pocket ; still looking at her brother with perfect composure said Brass triumphantly inquired Mr Swiveller said Brass , slapping all his pockets , one after another , and looking into his desk , and under it , and upon it , and wildly tossing the papers about cried Miss Sally , starting up , clapping her hands , and scattering the papers on the floor said Dick , looking at Brass with a face as pale as his own replied the lawyer , feeling in all his pockets with looks of the greatest agitation said Miss Sally , taking more snuff Mr Swiveller and Sampson Brass looked from Miss Sally to each other , in a state of bewilderment , and then , as by one impulse , caught up their hats and rushed out into the street -- darting along in the middle of the road , and dashing aside all obstructions , as though they were running for their lives .
