# text = And with that , he burst into a yell of laughter , manifestly to the great terror of the coachman , and pointed to a dyer's pole hard by , where a dangling suit of clothes bore some resemblance to a man upon a gibbet cried the dwarf , rubbing his hands violently With such good wishes and farewells , poured out in a rapid torrent until they were out of hearing , Quilp suffered them to depart ; and when he could see the coach no longer , drew in his head , and rolled upon the ground in an ecstacy of enjoyment .
