# text = When they reached the notary's , which they were not long in doing , for they had encountered the dwarf in a bye street at a very little distance from the house , Mr Brass dismounted ; and opening the coach door with a melancholy visage , requested his sister to accompany him into the office , with the view of preparing the good people within , for the mournful intelligence that awaited them .
