# text = Mr Swiveller , though an unwilling witness , could not help proving to demonstration , from the position in which it was found , that it must have been designedly secreted said Brass said the constable , looking round returned Mr Garland , to whom the man had put the question said Kit eagerly cried Brass , looking from face to face with an expression of stupid amazement said Kit cried Brass , shaking his head and frowning heavily asked Mr Garland , with great anxiety returned Sampson shrieked Kit asked the notary replied Brass , in a very grave manner cried Kit , on whom a light broke suddenly said Brass , smiling With such pacific and bantering remarks did Mr Brass refute the foul aspersion on his character ; but the virtuous Sarah , moved by stronger feelings , and having at heart , perhaps , a more jealous regard for the honour of her family , flew from her brother's side , without any previous intimation of her design , and darted at the prisoner with the utmost fury .
