# text = It was a long night , which seemed as though it would have no end ; but he slept too , and dreamed -- always of being at liberty , and roving about , now with one person and now with another , but ever with a vague dread of being recalled to prison ; not that prison , but one which was in itself a dim idea -- not of a place , but of a care and sorrow : of something oppressive and always present , and yet impossible to define .
