# text = As he paid this compliment to the merit of the absent charmer , Mr Brass came to a halt ; looking doubtfully towards the light , and over his shoulder murmured the lawyer , standing on tiptoe , and endeavouring to obtain a glimpse of what was passing inside , which at that distance was impossible Mr Quilp was certainly entertaining himself with vocal exercise , but it was rather a kind of chant than a song ; being a monotonous repetition of one sentence in a very rapid manner , with a long stress upon the last word , which he swelled into a dismal roar .
