# text = Although this might have been a very comical thing to look at from a secure gallery , as a bull-fight is found to be a comfortable spectacle by those who are not in the arena , and a house on fire is better than a play to people who don't live near it , there was something in the earnestness of Mr Quilp's manner which made his legal adviser feel that the counting-house was a little too small , and a deal too lonely , for the complete enjoyment of these humours .
