# text = The wretched Sampson took a few short sips of the liquor , which immediately distilled itself into burning tears , and in that form came rolling down his cheeks into the pipkin again , turning the colour of his face and eyelids to a deep red , and giving rise to a violent fit of coughing , in the midst of which he was still heard to declare , with the constancy of a martyr , that it was While he was yet in unspeakable agonies , the dwarf renewed their conversation said Quilp returned Brass , with intervals of coughing cried the dwarf replied Brass cried the dwarf replied Sampson said Quilp cried Brass said Brass sneered the dwarf rejoined Brass retorted Quilp said Sampson retorted the dwarf , viciously snapping at his words returned Brass
# sent_id = 2745
