# text = As it was plain that Sampson was bent on a complimentary harangue , unless he received a timely interruption , Mr Quilp politely tapped him on the crown of his head with the little saucepan , and requested that he would be so obliging as to hold his peace said Brass , rubbing the place and smiling returned Quilp cried Brass , glancing at the admiral again , as if he made a third in company said Quilp between his teeth returned Brass said Quilp returned Brass croaked the dwarf returned Brass replied the dwarf , seizing the saucepan suggested Brass humbly But to these remonstrances , Mr Quilp turned a deaf ear .
