# text = To this indictment , Christopher Nubbles , in a low and trembling voice , pleaded Not Guilty ; and here , let those who are in the habit of forming hasty judgments from appearances , and who would have had Christopher , if innocent , speak out very strong and loud , observe , that confinement and anxiety will subdue the stoutest hearts ; and that to one who has been close shut up , though it be only for ten or eleven days , seeing but stone walls and a very few stony faces , the sudden entrance into a great hall filled with life , is a rather disconcerting and startling circumstance .
