# text = It appeared , however , that she had only clapped her hands for joy ; for directly afterward she began to laugh , and then to cry ; declaring , not in choice Arabic but in familiar English , that she was said Mr Swiveller , thoughtfully The Marchioness only shook her head mournfully , and cried again ; whereupon Mr Swiveller ( being very weak ) felt his own eyes affected likewise said Richard after a pause , and smiling with a trembling lip replied the small servant , wiping her eyes said Dick replied the small servant Mr Swiveller was silent for a long while .
