# text = At this point , Mr Swiveller took the small servant's hand in his again , and being , as we have seen , but poorly , might in struggling to express his thanks have made his eyes as red as hers , but that she quickly changed the theme by making him lie down , and urging him to keep very quiet she told him The Marchioness , in saying these words , brought a little table to the bedside , took her seat at it , and began to work away at the concoction of some cooling drink , with the address of a score of chemists .
