# text = Richard Swiveller being indeed fatigued , fell into a slumber , and waking in about half an hour , inquired what time it was replied his small friend , helping him to sit up again said Richard , passing his hand over his forehead and turning suddenly round , as though the subject but that moment flashed upon him He had been sentenced to transportation for a great many years , she said asked Dick His nurse shook her head , and answered that she knew nothing about them said she , very slowly said Dick rejoined the small servant , with a horrified look Dick looked very earnestly at his little friend : and his eyes , being large and hollow from illness , assisted the expression so much , that she was quite frightened , and besought him not to think any more about it .
