# text = The pony made a moment's pause ; but , as if it occurred to him that to stop when he was required might be to establish an inconvenient and dangerous precedent , he immediately started off again , rattled at a fast trot to the street corner , wheeled round , came back , and then stopped of his own accord said the man -- who didn't venture by the bye to come out in his true colours until he was safe on the pavement said Mr Abel , tying a shawl round his neck as he came down the steps replied the hostler said Mr Abel , getting in , and taking the reins
