# text = But , not so Mr Abel ; or the strong man who emptied the hamper , big as it was , in a twinkling ; and not so the nice old lady , who appeared so suddenly that she might have come out of the hamper too ( it was quite large enough ), and who , bustling about on tiptoe and without noise -- now here , now there , now everywhere at once -- began to fill out the jelly in tea-cups , and to make chicken broth in small saucepans , and to peel oranges for the sick man and to cut them up in little pieces , and to ply the small servant with glasses of wine and choice bits of everything until more substantial meat could be prepared for her refreshment .
