# text = The communication performed its errand so well , that within ten minutes of the messenger's return and report of its delivery , Miss Brass herself was announced said the single gentleman , whom she found alone in the room Miss Brass sat herself down , in a very stiff and frigid state , and seemed -- as indeed she was -- not a little astonished to find that the lodger and her mysterious correspondent were one and the same person said the single gentleman returned the beauty retorted the single gentleman said Sally returned Miss Brass said the single gentleman , rising and opening the door of an inner room Mr Garland and the Notary walked in , looking very grave ; and , drawing up two chairs , one on each side of the single gentleman , formed a kind of fence round the gentle Sarah , and penned her into a corner .
