# text = Although her face was wonderfully composed , it was apparent that she was wholly taken by surprise , and that what she had expected to be taxed with , in connection with her small servant , was something very different from this said the Notary said Mr Witherden , pulling out his watch With a smile upon her face , and looking at each of the three by turns , Miss Brass took two or three more pinches of snuff , and having by this time very little left , travelled round and round the box with her forefinger and thumb , scraping up another .
