# text = Besides you -- you're disappointed , Sarah , and , not knowing what you say , expose yourself retorted the lovely damsel simpered Brass , who , in his deep debasement , really seemed to have changed sexes with his sister , and to have made over to her any spark of manliness he might have possessed added Brass , allowing himself to be slightly overcome With deference to the better opinion of Mr Brass , and more particularly to the authority of his Great Ancestor , it may be doubted , with humility , whether the elevating principle laid down by the latter gentleman , and acted upon by his descendant , is always a prudent one , or attended in practice with the desired results .
