# text = When it had been twice or thrice repeated , he softly opened the little window , and thrusting his head out , demanded who was there replied a woman's voice cried the dwarf , stretching his neck to obtain a better view of his visitor rejoined his spouse said the dwarf rejoined his wife said Quilp cried the meek little woman said Quilp , interrupting her urged his submissive wife , in tears growled the dwarf with a malicious grin said Mrs Quilp , trembling she added , as her husband stretched out his hand for it Her amiable husband hesitated for a few moments ; but , bethinking himself that the letter might require some answer , of which she could be the bearer , closed the window , opened the door , and bade her enter .
