# text = And even when the rest have in some measure come to themselves again , and can find words and smiles , Barbara -- that soft-hearted , gentle , foolish little Barbara -- is suddenly missed , and found to be in a swoon by herself in the back parlour , from which swoon she falls into hysterics , and from which hysterics into a swoon again , and is , indeed , so bad , that despite a mortal quantity of vinegar and cold water she is hardly a bit better at last than she was at first .
