# text = So well , indeed , was his modest and retiring temper understood by those with whom he had to deal , and so jealous were they of his absence , that they required a kind of friendly bond to be entered into by two substantial housekeepers , in the sum of fifteen hundred pounds a-piece , before they would suffer him to quit their hospitable roof -- doubting , it appeared , that he would return , if once let loose , on any other terms .
